👮 **Wachiman** · 🟡📝 **Consider · docs: Fallback to the full file list is undocumented after the docblock moved (confidence high)**

The docblock moved from `fetchWorkspaceFilePaths` to `useWorkspaceFilePaths`, so the exported function now has no comment. Its non-obvious behaviour is the `ROUTE_NOT_FOUND` fallback to `/workspace/files`, which drops deleted files and re-shapes the response (lines 2219-2227). A one-line comment there would say why the second request exists. The move is also unrelated churn in this PR.

